<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Contacto y Soporte — Möno</title>
    <link href="https://api.fontshare.com/v2/css?f[]=satoshi@400,500,700,800,900&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css">
    <style>
        body {
            background-color: #14181C;
            color: #FFFFFF;
            font-family: 'Satoshi', -apple-system, sans-serif;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            min-height: 100vh;
        }
        .contact-hero {
            padding: 60px 0 36px;
            text-align: center;
            border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);
        }
        .contact-badge {
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 6px;
            background: rgba(255,85,0,0.15);
            border: 1px solid rgba(255,85,0,0.3);
            padding: 5px 14px;
            border-radius: 99px;
            font-size: 12px;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: var(--orange);
            margin-bottom: 16px;
        }
        .contact-title {
            font-size: 38px;
            font-weight: 900;
            letter-spacing: -1.2px;
            margin: 0 0 10px 0;
            color: #FFFFFF;
        }
        .contact-wrap {
            max-width: 620px;
            margin: 48px auto;
            background: #181D22;
            border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);
            border-radius: 16px;
            padding: 40px;
            box-shadow: 0 8px 32px rgba(0,0,0,0.5);
        }
        .form-group {
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }
        .form-group label {
            display: block;
            font-size: 12px;
            font-weight: 700;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 0.6px;
            color: var(--muted);
            margin-bottom: 8px;
        }
        .form-input, .form-textarea, .form-select {
            width: 100%;
            box-sizing: border-box;
            background: #14181C;
            border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.12);
            border-radius: 8px;
            padding: 12px 14px;
            font-size: 14px;
            font-family: inherit;
            color: #FFFFFF;
            outline: none;
            transition: all 0.2s ease;
        }
        .form-input:focus, .form-textarea:focus, .form-select:focus {
            border-color: var(--orange);
            background: #14181C;
            box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(255, 85, 0, 0.2);
        }
        .btn-submit-contact {
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            gap: 8px;
            background: var(--orange);
            color: #FFF;
            border: none;
            border-radius: var(--r-full, 9999px);
            padding: 14px 24px;
            font-size: 15px;
            font-weight: 700;
            font-family: inherit;
            cursor: pointer;
            width: 100%;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(255,85,0,0.35);
            transition: background 0.18s ease, transform 0.15s ease;
        }
        .btn-submit-contact:hover {
            background: #E54B00;
            transform: translateY(-1px);
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <%- include('partials/nav') %>

    <div class="contact-hero">
        <div class="wrap">
            <div class="contact-badge">
                <span>📬</span> Estamos aquí para escucharte
            </div>
            <h1 class="contact-title">Contacto y Sugerencias</h1>
            <p style="color:var(--muted); font-size:15px; max-width:500px; margin:0 auto; line-height:1.6;">
                ¿Tenés una sugerencia, encontraste un error en los episodios o querés reportar un problema? Envíanos un mensaje.
            </p>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="wrap">
        <div class="contact-wrap">
            <form onsubmit="handleContactSubmit(event)">
                <div class="form-group">
                    <label>Tu Nombre o Usuario</label>
                    <input type="text" class="form-input" placeholder="Ej: Spike Spiegel" required>
                </div>

                <div class="form-group">
                    <label>Correo Electrónico</label>
                    <input type="email" class="form-input" placeholder="tu-email@ejemplo.com" required>
                </div>

                <div class="form-group">
                    <label>Motivo del Mensaje</label>
                    <select class="form-select" required>
                        <option value="feedback">Sugerencia de función / Feedback</option>
                        <option value="bug">Reportar un error o glitch</option>
                        <option value="anime_data">Corrección de episodios o datos de anime</option>
                        <option value="api">Consulta de API para desarrolladores</option>
                        <option value="other">Otro asunto</option>
                    </select>
                </div>

                <div class="form-group">
                    <label>Mensaje</label>
                    <textarea class="form-textarea" rows="5" placeholder="Escribinos con todo el detalle que desees..." required></textarea>
                </div>

                <button type="submit" class="btn-submit-contact" id="contact-btn">
                    <span>Enviar Mensaje</span>
                </button>
            </form>
            <div id="contact-success" style="display:none; text-align:center; padding:20px; background:rgba(34,197,94,0.15); border:1px solid rgba(34,197,94,0.3); border-radius:10px; margin-top:20px; color:#4ADE80; font-weight:600; font-size:14px;">
                ✓ ¡Gracias por tu mensaje! Nos pondremos en contacto pronto.
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <script>
        function handleContactSubmit(e) {
            e.preventDefault();
            const btn = document.getElementById('contact-btn');
            btn.disabled = true;
            btn.innerText = 'Enviando...';
            setTimeout(() => {
                btn.style.display = 'none';
                document.getElementById('contact-success').style.display = 'block';
            }, 600);
        }
    </script>

    <%- include('partials/footer') %>
</body>
</html>
